                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "zyxWe",
                      "name": "Note Line",
                      "fill": "$ink-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "· 连续多张图写在同一个组图块中（写法待定），按张数自动排列：2 张 2 列；3 张 3 列；4 张 2×2；5–9 张 3 列",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "UzQIC",
                      "name": "Note Line",
                      "fill": "$ink-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "· 每张是一个卡片：内边距 8、卡片圆角 16、图片圆角 8（radius）；图片正方形 cover 裁切；灯箱中显示完整原图",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "THjgm",
                      "name": "Note Line",
                      "fill": "$ink-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "· 平时彩色；鼠标移入组图后变为灰度 + 压暗 12%，光标处半径 260px 的柔边聚光恢复彩色并平滑跟随（damping 0.45），离开后 0.6s 淡回彩色",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "M81AB",
                      "name": "Note Line",
                      "fill": "$ink-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "· 光标所在卡片：描边亮起该图主色（上传时提取），底部泛起主色微光；单元格内动态照片仍显示 LiveBadge、悬停播放；点击打开 Lightbox",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "NFvJk",
                      "name": "Note Line",
                      "fill": "$ink-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "· 手机（350px）：2–4 张 2 列，5 张以上 3 列；触屏不触发聚光（只响应鼠标）；prefers-reduced-motion 时聚光不做跟随缓动",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
