                          "content": "博客这件事，我断断续续做了好几年。每次都是兴冲冲地选框架、调样式，写了三五篇就搁下了。后来想明白，问题不在工具，而在写作这件事离我太远：要开编辑器、要 commit、要等构建。",
                          "lineHeight": 1.8,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-prose",
                          "fontSize": 16,
                          "fontWeight": "normal",
                          "letterSpacing": 0.14
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "fz8TF",
                      "name": "Para",
                      "fill": "$ink",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "　　所以这一次，我给自己定了一个很朴素的目标：打开浏览器就能写，写完点一下就能发。读者那一侧要足够安静，安静到只剩下文字。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.8,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-prose",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "letterSpacing": 0.14
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "S924N",
                      "name": "Figure",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "layout": "vertical",
                      "padding": [
                        12,
                        0
                      ],
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "id": "noVaU",
                          "type": "ref",
                          "ref": "HjxqQ",
                          "name": "ArticleImage/Live",
                          "width": "fill_container"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "ig631",
                      "name": "H2",
                      "fill": "$ink",
                      "content": "为什么是 Astro",
                      "lineHeight": 1.4,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-prose-heading",
                      "fontSize": 24,
                      "fontWeight": "700",
                      "letterSpacing": 0.8
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "f5InOY",
                      "name": "Para",
                      "fill": "$ink",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "　　读者页面几乎全是静态内容，最适合预渲染；写作页面却需要登录、需要接口。Astro 5 的混合渲染刚好把两件事放进同一个项目里：读者页走缓存，写作页走 SSR，彼此互不打扰。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.8,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-prose",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "letterSpacing": 0.14
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "LL1jX",
                      "name": "Blockquote",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "layout": "vertical",
                      "gap": 6,
                      "padding": [
                        4,
                        24
                      ],
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "gfSua",
                          "name": "Mark",
                          "fill": "$accent",
                          "content": "“",
                          "lineHeight": 1,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-prose",
                          "fontSize": 44,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "HNsqQ",
                          "name": "Quote",
                          "fill": "$ink-muted",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "工具应该让人忘记它的存在。当你开始注意到锤子的时候，往往是钉子没钉好。",
                          "lineHeight": 1.8,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-prose",
                          "fontSize": 16,
                          "fontWeight": "normal",
                          "fontStyle": "italic"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "W4n7C",
                          "name": "Cite",
                          "fill": "$ink-faint",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "— 海德格尔《存在与时间》",
                          "textAlign": "right",
                          "fontFamily": "$font-prose",
                          "fontSize": 13,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "LYId5",
                      "name": "Para",
                      "fill": "$ink",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "　　数据放在 Cloudflare D1，图片放 R2，整个站点跑在边缘节点上。读取一篇文章的查询只有一行：",
                      "lineHeight": 1.8,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-prose",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "letterSpacing": 0.14
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "tlpjK",
                      "name": "Code Block",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "fill": "$surface-sunken",
                      "cornerRadius": "$radius",
                      "layout": "vertical",
                      "gap": 4,
                      "padding": [
                        16,
                        20
                      ],
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "jH77g",
                          "name": "Line",
                          "fill": "$ink",
                          "content": "const post = await db",
                          "lineHeight": 1.6,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                          "fontSize": 13,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "iyVUq",
                          "name": "Line",
                          "fill": "$ink",
                          "content": "  .prepare('SELECT * FROM posts WHERE slug = ? AND status = ?')",
                          "lineHeight": 1.6,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                          "fontSize": 13,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "xCvwj",
                          "name": "Line",
                          "fill": "$ink",
                          "content": "  .bind(slug, 'published')",
                          "lineHeight": 1.6,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                          "fontSize": 13,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "g9080",
                          "name": "Line",
                          "fill": "$ink",
                          "content": "  .first();",
                          "lineHeight": 1.6,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                          "fontSize": 13,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "FIFW7",
                      "name": "Para",
                      "fill": "$ink",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "　　剩下的事情，就是把写作页做得顺手一点：实时预览、拖拽上传图片、每隔几秒自动保存。这些细节我会在后面几篇里慢慢展开。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.8,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-prose",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "letterSpacing": 0.14
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
